I'm gonna go check
on Genevieve.

749
01:14:39,187 --> 01:14:41,393
Hendricks ?

750
01:14:41,425 --> 01:14:43,361
What ?

751
01:14:46,062 --> 01:14:49,068
For a man who's gone
to such great lengths
to modify his appearance,

752
01:14:49,096 --> 01:14:52,871
you certainly are
reluctant to be seen.

753
01:14:55,202 --> 01:14:57,875
Where are you at,
Carleton ?

754
01:14:57,906 --> 01:15:02,482
A name is not a matter
for indifference.

755
01:15:02,510 --> 01:15:04,380
It implies a whole series
of relationships...

756
01:15:04,378 --> 01:15:09,656
between the one who bears it
and the source from which
it is derived.

757
01:15:09,683 --> 01:15:12,556
Call me Captain Howdy.

758
01:15:12,585 --> 01:15:14,857
"Derived" ?

759
01:15:14,889 --> 01:15:18,161
Your father was
a Marine war hero.

760
01:15:18,191 --> 01:15:20,395
Captain Bradford Hendricks.

761
01:15:22,128 --> 01:15:25,100
Is this how you
honor his name ?

762
01:15:25,131 --> 01:15:28,103
Call me Captain Howdy.

763
01:15:29,702 --> 01:15:32,074
I need to talk to you.

764
01:15:32,104 --> 01:15:34,809
So ? Talk.

765
01:15:36,741 --> 01:15:39,916
Why can't you face me ?

766
01:15:39,945 --> 01:15:42,749
Maybe you're not used to
dealin' with anyone
who's not restrained...

767
01:15:42,780 --> 01:15:45,887
and mouth isn't sewn shut.

768
01:15:45,918 --> 01:15:48,456
Is that what's
bothering you, Carl ?

769
01:15:48,487 --> 01:15:52,528
Some regard it
as evidence of bravery...

770
01:15:52,557 --> 01:15:55,597
for a man to go into battle
bearing no weapon...

771
01:15:55,627 --> 01:15:59,233
that can do any harm
at a distance.

772
01:15:59,262 --> 01:16:03,138
It's easy to be hard
from behind your mama's skirt.

773
01:16:12,910 --> 01:16:14,879
Gage !

774
01:16:14,912 --> 01:16:17,951
What is it ?
My gun ?

775
01:16:17,980 --> 01:16:20,987
Is that what's
bothering you ?

776
01:16:21,017 --> 01:16:22,954
Here.

777
01:16:26,989 --> 01:16:29,528
You know what I
find intriguing ?

778
01:16:29,558 --> 01:16:32,497
That for all your rhetoric
and endless preening,

779
01:16:32,528 --> 01:16:36,135
you're no more
than a schoolyard bully
with a persecution complex.

780
01:16:36,163 --> 01:16:39,070
You pick on those
that are weak.

781
01:16:39,100 --> 01:16:40,836
You run off and hide.
-Huh ?

782
01:16:42,737 --> 01:16:46,044
How 'bout I come over there
and beat the dog shit
out of you ?

783
01:16:46,074 --> 01:16:48,845
Who's stopping you ?

784
01:16:55,314 --> 01:16:58,055
First you dream,
and then you die.

785
01:17:21,907 --> 01:17:24,278
Ah-choo !

786
01:17:24,309 --> 01:17:27,115
Ah-choo !

787
01:17:28,746 --> 01:17:32,320
They all... fall down.

788
01:17:32,348 --> 01:17:34,787
Good-bye, Michael.

789
01:17:34,819 --> 01:17:38,927
Mmm.

790
01:18:07,249 --> 01:18:10,756
You know, Daddy,
Genevieve screamed.

791
01:18:10,784 --> 01:18:13,290
No !

792
01:18:19,660 --> 01:18:21,564
Aaah !

793
01:18:28,636 --> 01:18:30,640
Michael.

794
01:18:30,671 --> 01:18:33,143
Don't be afraid to die.

795
01:18:36,342 --> 01:18:40,918
Death is the standard
by which the reality and depth
of all things can be judged.

796
01:18:44,884 --> 01:18:47,222
Genevieve will be
joining you soon.

797
01:18:58,063 --> 01:19:00,635
Long is the pain,
short is the ornament !

798
01:19:04,602 --> 01:19:06,874
No !

799
01:19:09,675 --> 01:19:14,283
- What's the matter,
Carleton ?

800
01:19:14,311 --> 01:19:18,152
- You angry with me ?
- You know,

801
01:19:19,749 --> 01:19:23,824
Michael,
I'll bet Genevieve--

802
01:19:23,854 --> 01:19:26,058
I bet Genevieve felt
a lot like this...

803
01:19:26,089 --> 01:19:30,097
when I was inside her.

804
01:19:32,261 --> 01:19:34,701
No.

805
01:19:36,833 --> 01:19:40,372
Oh, what are you gonna
do now, arrest me ?

806
01:19:55,449 --> 01:19:57,421
What's the matter,
Carleton ?

807
01:19:57,451 --> 01:19:59,890
You afraid ?

808
01:19:59,922 --> 01:20:04,663
You told me you've never
been afraid of anything
in your whole life,

809
01:20:04,658 --> 01:20:07,164
'cause you wished
you were dead.

810
01:20:07,193 --> 01:20:10,266
Isn't that how it was ?

811
01:20:10,297 --> 01:20:12,267
This is for Genevieve,
you fuck.

812
01:20:12,299 --> 01:20:14,170
No. No !

813
01:20:17,871 --> 01:20:20,108
Yaaah !

814
01:20:20,141 --> 01:20:22,377
Yaah !

815
01:20:26,811 --> 01:20:30,854
Pain is a uniquely
personal experience,
Carleton.

816
01:20:30,883 --> 01:20:35,091
You--

817
01:20:42,426 --> 01:20:45,400
No ! No ! No !

818
01:20:45,429 --> 01:20:49,472
No !

819
01:20:51,335 --> 01:20:53,072
No !

820
01:21:10,186 --> 01:21:12,456
Aaah !

821
01:21:12,489 --> 01:21:14,961
Mike, it's me.
Come on, he's dead.

822
01:21:17,326 --> 01:21:20,466
It's over.

823
01:21:20,495 --> 01:21:21,966
Aaaah !

824
01:21:41,516 --> 01:21:43,888
Mike, man.

825
01:21:43,919 --> 01:21:47,025
You didn't have
a choice.

826
01:21:47,054 --> 01:21:50,028
Everybody's
got a choice.

827
01:21:50,057 --> 01:21:52,429
I just made mine.

828
01:21:54,929 --> 01:21:58,435
Tell Internal Affairs
I'm going to the hospital.
Are you hurt ?

829
01:21:58,465 --> 01:22:00,971
I'm fine.

830
01:22:01,000 --> 01:22:04,106
I'm gonna go see
my family.

